Package: flickos-style-aye3
Architecture: all
# flickos-layouts 1.57: desktop buttons in waybar (flickos/desktops) and
# layouts read from other packages' folders; arc-theme and numix-icon-theme:
# the GTK and icon themes Aye3 names (on every FlickOS system already, so
# installing it adds only its own files).
Depends: flickos-layouts (>= 1.57),
         arc-theme,
         numix-icon-theme,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Aye3wm style and layout for the FlickOS desktop
 A dark style for FlickOS in the look of a classic tiling desktop: flat
 slate blue title bars on the focused window and grey ones on the others,
 thin borders, a black terminal, a plain grey app launcher, slate blue
 notifications and a near-black wallpaper with FlickOS's halo.
 .
 Its layout is one black bar at the bottom: the desktops as numbered boxes
 on the left (4 desktops), the status as monospace text on the right.
 .
 Installing it adds Aye3wm to Desktop Layout & Style; Software's Use sets the
 style and the layout together.
